pebble-watchface-heartburn uses icons from the following fonts:

    Battery icons from Typicons (licensed SIL OFL 1.1): https://github.com/stephenhutchings/typicons.font

    Help icon from Font Awesome v4.7.0 (licensed SIL OFL 1.1): https://github.com/FortAwesome/Font-Awesome

    Heart icon from Font Awesome Solid v7.2.0 (licensed SIL OFL 1.1): https://github.com/FortAwesome/Font-Awesome

    Sunrise/sunset icons from Lucide (licensed ISC): https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide

    Weather icons from Meteocons: https://www.alessioatzeni.com/meteocons/
